      <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50 sm:text-6xl">Mining</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 dark:text-neutral-400 text-neutral-600">Kryptokrona is a cryptocurrency that utilizes proof-of-work mining to establish distributed consensus. The information and resources provided below will assist you in getting started with mining. Please note that the Kryptokrona Project does not endorse any specific pool, software, or hardware; the content presented here is for informational purposes only.</p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 dark:text-neutral-400 text-neutral-600">A core tenet of Kryptokrona's philosophy is to promote equitable mining opportunities for everyone. To that end, Kryptokrona uses <span class="font-semibold dark:text-neutral-200 text-neutral-800">CryptoNight-Turtle</span>, a lightweight, ASIC-resistant proof-of-work algorithm. Because specialized ASIC hardware gains no advantage, anyone with an ordinary computer can compete on equal footing — and CPU mining is significantly more efficient than GPU mining here.</p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 dark:text-neutral-400 text-neutral-600">The recommended way to mine is <span class="font-semibold dark:text-neutral-200 text-neutral-800">p2pool</span> — a decentralized mining pool that combines the steady, regular payouts of a pool with the trustlessness of solo mining. There is no pool operator and virtually no fees: your rewards are paid <span class="font-semibold dark:text-neutral-200 text-neutral-800">directly to your own wallet</span>, automatically. It is the fairest and most decentralized way to mine XKR, and the best place to start.</p>

